%!PS
% SPDX-FileCopyrightText: 2026 EfterScript contributors
% SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
% backend: none
% expect-output: hello
% expect-output: after
% Scenario: closefile on a filter over currentfile. The procedure reads
% five bytes through the filter and closes it; the close consumes the
% rest of the data through the `~>` marker, so the scanner resumes at
% the line after it.
% Expect: hello, after. The structuring comments bound the data for
% tools that scan the file rather than run it.
/readit { currentfile /ASCII85Decode filter dup 5 string readstring pop = closefile } def
%%BeginData: 2 ASCII Lines
readit
BOu!rDZ~>
%%EndData
(after) =
